   "title": "The Grand Workbench Commander",
   "note": "Your custom GEN2 build · 3 units, 3 drawers, 2 columns wide. Drag to orbit, tap any part to identify it. 30 prints · quantities on the right. and 6× 10×2 mm disc magnets for the optional magnet closures (hardware store items).",
